{
  "id": "pipes_and_cylinders___conductive_heat_loss",
  "title": "Pipes and Cylinders - Conductive Heat Loss",
  "description": "Calculate conductive heat loss through uninsulated or insulated pipes and cylinders using thermal conductivity and temperature differences.",
  "type": "calculator",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "# Pipes and Cylinders - Conductive Heat Loss\n\nCalculate conductive heat loss through the wall of uninsulated or insulated cylinders and pipes.\n\n## Uninsulated Cylinder or Pipe\n**Q = 2π L (tᵢ - tₒ) / (ln(rₒ / rᵢ) / k)**\n\n## Insulated Cylinder or Pipe\n**Q = 2π L (tᵢ - tₒ) / ((ln(rₒ / rᵢ) / k) + (ln(rₛ / rₒ) / kₛ))**\n\n## Insulated Cylinder or Pipe with Convective Heat Resistance\n**Q = 2π L (tᵢ - tₒ) / (1 / (hc rᵢ) + (ln(rₒ / rᵢ) / k) + (ln(rₛ / rₒ) / kₛ))**"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "headers": [
        "Configuration Type"
      ],
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "config_type",
          "label": "Configuration Type",
          "type": "select",
          "options": [
            {
              "label": "Uninsulated Cylinder or Pipe",
              "value": "uninsulated"
            },
            {
              "label": "Insulated Cylinder or Pipe",
              "value": "insulated"
            },
            {
              "label": "Insulated with Convective Heat Resistance",
              "value": "insulated_convective"
            }
          ],
          "defaultValue": "uninsulated"
        }
      ],
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "headers": [
        "Basic Parameters"
      ],
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "L",
          "label": "Length (L)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "m",
          "defaultValue": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "ti",
          "label": "Inside Temperature (tᵢ)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "°C",
          "defaultValue": 100
        },
        {
          "id": "to",
          "label": "Outside Temperature (tₒ)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "°C",
          "defaultValue": 20
        },
        {
          "id": "ri",
          "label": "Inside Radius (rᵢ)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "m",
          "defaultValue": 0.05
        },
        {
          "id": "ro",
          "label": "Outside Radius (rₒ)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "m",
          "defaultValue": 0.06
        },
        {
          "id": "k",
          "label": "Thermal Conductivity (k)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "W/mK",
          "defaultValue": 50
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "Q_uninsulated",
          "label": "Heat Transfer (Q) - Uninsulated",
          "unit": "W",
          "format": "decimal",
          "formula": "2 * 3.14159 * inputs.L * (inputs.ti - inputs.to) / (Math.log(inputs.ro / inputs.ri) / inputs.k)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "headers": [
        "Insulation Parameters"
      ],
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "rs",
          "label": "Outside Radius of Insulation (rₛ)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "m",
          "defaultValue": 0.08
        },
        {
          "id": "ks",
          "label": "Thermal Conductivity of Insulation (kₛ)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "W/mK",
          "defaultValue": 0.05
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "Q_insulated",
          "label": "Heat Transfer (Q) - Insulated",
          "unit": "W",
          "format": "decimal",
          "formula": "2 * 3.14159 * inputs.L * (inputs.ti - inputs.to) / ((Math.log(inputs.ro / inputs.ri) / inputs.k) + (Math.log(inputs.rs / inputs.ro) / inputs.ks))"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "headers": [
        "Convective Heat Transfer Parameters"
      ],
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "hc",
          "label": "Convective Heat Transfer Coefficient (hc)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "W/m²K",
          "defaultValue": 10
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "Q_insulated_convective",
          "label": "Heat Transfer (Q) - Insulated with Convective Resistance",
          "unit": "W",
          "format": "decimal",
          "formula": "2 * 3.14159 * inputs.L * (inputs.ti - inputs.to) / ((1 / (inputs.hc * inputs.ri)) + (Math.log(inputs.ro / inputs.ri) / inputs.k) + (Math.log(inputs.rs / inputs.ro) / inputs.ks))"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}